# /alembic/README
Alembic migration environment for the self-healing ML serving platform.

Phase 0: directory created; env.py and initial migration added in Phase 1
when the first SQLAlchemy models are defined.

Common commands:
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"   # create a migration
  alembic upgrade head                               # apply all migrations
  alembic downgrade -1                               # roll back one step
  alembic history                                    # show migration history
